# TYPE:   feat | fix | perf | refactor | ctrl | sim | model |
#         data | embed | docs | chore | test
# SCOPE:  chassis | gimbal | yaw | booster | lqr | vmc | mpc |
#         kalman | observer | imu | encoder | fdcan | usart |
#         motor | power | sim | kinematics | linkage | build |
#         rtos | hal | debug
# SUBJECT: 动词开头，≤72字符，不加句号
# ============================================================

type(scope): subject


